# Deploy

Deploy using the project's standard pipeline.

## Steps

1. Run `{{TEST_CMD}}` — abort if tests fail
2. Run `{{BUILD_CMD}}` — abort if build fails
3. Confirm target environment with the user (staging vs production)
4. Execute the deploy command for this stack: `{{DEPLOY_CMD}}`
5. Run a smoke check after deploy
6. Report deployment status and any rollback steps

Never deploy with failing tests unless the user explicitly overrides.